.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH qrab 1  "qrab 0.1.5" 
.SH NAME
qrab \- Readable quantum circuits for TikZ, Typst/Quill, SVG, and Quirk
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBqrab\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Readable quantum circuits for TikZ, Typst/Quill, SVG, and Quirk
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
qrab\-check(1)
Check a circuit without rendering it
.TP
qrab\-compile(1)
Compile a circuit to LaTeX, Typst, SVG, Quirk, or all of them
.TP
qrab\-import\-quirk(1)
Convert a Quirk URL to qrab source
.TP
qrab\-install\-skill(1)
Install the qrab agent skill in the current project
.SH VERSION
v0.1.5
